      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鏽蝕組那件事多謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "93FD87557D4490A34EF64E8B591A8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說那時的耿鬼，\n我最近都沒見到牠。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA90A366427684803F9B3CFF0C000A621167008FD190FD6C92898B523072603002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎，畢竟是野生的寶可夢，\n牠會隨興到處去也是理所當然。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CEFF0C75627ADF662F91CE751F76845BF653EF5922FF0C000A7260670396A882085230865553BB4E5F662F74066240757671363002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，平常總是會看到的傢伙不見了，\n讓我好像有點寂寞，又有點擔心。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C5E735E387E3D662F6703770B5230768450A24F194E0D898B4E86FF0C000A8B936211597D50CF67099EDE5BC25BDEFF0C53C867099EDE64D45FC33002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，雖然這個請求有點奇怪，\n但如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能幫我找耿鬼，我會很高興的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C96D671369019500B8ACB6C4267099EDE5947602AFF0C000A4F465982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD5E6B6211627E803F9B3CFF0C621167035F889AD8820876843002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "關於幽靈屬性的寶可夢的事，\n去找正義社的沐淨準沒錯！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我們往道場去吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95DC65BC5E7D97485C6C602776845BF653EF592276844E8BFF0C000A53BB627E6B637FA9793E76846C906DE86E966C92932FFF0100100001BE00000A621150115F809053583453BB54273002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "事情我理解了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8B60C56211740689E34E86300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我有個條件。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4662116709500B689D4EF6300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "與我對戰吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "820762115C0D62305427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會贏的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167038D0F76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不太想耶",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D592A60F380360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就繼續摸不著門路吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C317E7C7E8C64784E0D845795808DEF5427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是我的復仇之戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F621176845FA94EC74E4B6230300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
