      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然強……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C71365F372026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這位，\n簡單說明來意吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4DFF0C000A7C2155AE8AAA660E4F86610F5427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……原來如此，\n那的確會擔心。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026539F4F8659826B64FF0C000A90A3768478BA670364D45FC3300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一聽之後，我已掌握\n要找的耿鬼的個性了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00807D4E4B5F8CFF0C62115DF2638C63E1000A8981627E7684803F9B3C7684500B60274E86300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我的搭檔水晶燈火靈\n追蹤氣息吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9362117684642D6A946C34667671C8706B9748000A8FFD8E646C23606F5427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但說到幽靈屬性的寶可夢，\n有的會在一處紮根，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有的喜愛四處漂泊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F468AAA52305E7D97485C6C602776845BF653EF5922FF0C000A67097684670357284E0086557D2E6839FF0C00100001BE00000A67097684559C611B56DB86556F026CCA300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我話說在前面。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562118A718AAA5728524D9762300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別太期待。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5225592A671F5F85300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道的。\n只要能知道牠過得還不錯就行了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E5905376843002000A53EA898180FD77E590537260904E5F9790844E0D932F5C31884C4E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水晶燈火靈，\n能知道什麼嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
