      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6676FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "根據水晶燈火靈，\n要找的耿鬼說不定是在<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n秀麗世大酒店。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
