      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "的確，有歷史的飯店\n總是少不了鬧鬼的故事沒錯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
