      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這裡？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901988E1FF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "晶！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6676FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "澄月廊街？\n真古怪……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6F8467085ECA8857FF1F000A771F53E4602A2026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "耿鬼那傢伙，\n說不定是開始愛打扮了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "803F9B3C90A350A24F19FF0C000A8AAA4E0D5B9A662F958B59CB611B6253626E4E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是到有我愛的晶火的\n幽影廊街啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F523067096211611B76846676706B7684000A5E7D5F715ECA8857554A300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我們去澄月廊街吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C6211501153BB6F8467085ECA885754273002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這裡感覺比較像是\n耿鬼牠會待的地方。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901988E1611F89BA6BD48F0350CF662F000A803F9B3C726067035F857684573065B93002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 2588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水晶燈火靈，\n能知道什麼嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C34667671C8706B9748FF0C000A80FD77E590534EC09EBC55CEFF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "晶！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6676FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕威？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 2648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54955A01FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是牠。\n我聽叫聲就能知道。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 2672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F72603002000A6211807D53EB80725C3180FD77E590533002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "耿鬼～！\n你別跑太遠。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 2712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "803F9B3CFF5EFF01000A4F6052258DD1592A906030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "該回家囉。\n晚餐是耿鬼你喜歡的燉菜喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A7256DE5BB656C93002000A665A9910662F803F9B3C4F60559C6B61768471C983DC559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕威威。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54955A015A0130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了委託人，\n水晶燈火靈……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E8659D48A174EBAFF0C000A6C34667671C8706B97482026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒關係，不要緊了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9295DC4FC2FF0C4E0D89817DCA4E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然連沐淨和水晶燈火靈都找不到，\n我這下可以甘心放手了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 2856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E2713690236C906DE8548C6C34667671C8706B974890FD627E4E0D5230FF0C000A621190194E0B53EF4EE575185FC3653E624B4E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F462026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "誰叫我當初不先當牠的訓練家，\n結果等到牠不見了才在拼命找。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AB053EB62117576521D4E0D51487576726076848A137DF45BB6FF0C000A7D50679C7B49523072604E0D898B4E86624D572862FC547D627E3002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但那時覺得眼角不經意能瞄到那傢伙，\n那樣的距離感是恰到好處的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4690A3664289BA5F97773C89D24E0D7D93610F80FD7784523090A350A24F19FF0C000A90A36A2376848DDD96E2611F662F60705230597D865576843002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這也是算是緣分吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們這麼\n將心比心地陪我找牠！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194E5F662F7B97662F7DE352065427300200100001BE01000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3501190199EBC000A5C075FC36BD45FC35730966A6211627E7260FF01001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鞭長莫及……\n抱歉了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "97AD957783AB53CA20262026000A62B16B494E862026202600100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那隻耿鬼會在意時不時尚？\n如果真的是那樣，倒也挺好玩的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 3200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A396BB803F9B3C67035728610F66424E0D66425C1AFF1F000A5982679C771F7684662F90A36A23FF0C50124E5F633A597D73A976843002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿N",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF004E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n這傢伙竟然悄悄飄回來了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A901950A24F197ADF71366084608498C456DE4F864E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……哽。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202654FD30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說不定牠又會不見，\n說不定到時候牠就不會回來了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但是，我會珍惜\n有這傢伙在這裡的時間的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA4E0D5B9A726053C867034E0D898BFF0C000A8AAA4E0D5B9A52306642501972605C314E0D670356DE4F864E86300200100001BE01000A4F46662FFF0C6211670373CD60DC000A6709901950A24F195728901988E176846642959376843002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我把耿鬼牠回來的事\n也告訴沐淨了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211628A803F9B3C726056DE4F8676844E8B000A4E5F544A8A346C906DE84E863002001000020114018C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……哽哽。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202654FD54FD30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    }
